// expect: 134 trap: a pattern's claim failed at tests/micros/mn-trap-claim-says:9:3 — Dot arrived
// A one-arm match is the author's claim about a value's shape, and a value
// the claim does not hold for stops the run saying so: the claim, its
// address, and the constructor that arrived. On boot 5addc081 the run stopped
// at a bare unreachable, the engine's backtrace all it said.
type Shape = Dot | Line(Int) | Box(Int, Int)

fn width(s) = match s {
  Box(w, _) => w,
}

fn main() = width(Dot)
